A line at a description's body column in a div in an item stays in the description

```
- :::
  :: t
  : a
    > q
  :::
.
<ul>
  <li>
    <div>
      <dl>
        <dt>t</dt>
        <dd>
          <p>a</p>
          <blockquote><p>q</p></blockquote>
        </dd>
      </dl>
    </div>
  </li>
</ul>
```

```
- :::
  :: t
  : a

    ~~~
    x
  :::
.
<ul>
  <li>
    <div>
      <dl>
        <dt>t</dt>
        <dd>
          <p>a</p>
          <pre><code>x
</code></pre>
        </dd>
      </dl>
    </div>
  </li>
</ul>
```
